// Independent pre-tee bodies from reviewed sibling artifacts, never combined output.
// Casts: /tmp/wasm-lowbit-review-6a5644be-corpus/{plain,basic}.wasm
// SHA-256 plain 1c123184c8568d0871b8c77df6a2e1d120b96401f3131543623804c4e6eabee0
// basic d8a92ae64cabb99aeb15c6575d7587d1211c2c2f5ce90ad6a3055645d0962732
